# Copy to apps/mobile/.env (optional — tagging works offline without this file)
#
# ── HuddleStat Cloud sync (optional) ─────────────────────────────────────────
# Point at a huddlestat Convex deployment. Requires sibling platform repo
# or a hosted HuddleStat Cloud URL.
#
# Physical iPad: use https://….convex.cloud (not 127.0.0.1)
#
# EXPO_PUBLIC_CONVEX_URL=https://your-deployment.convex.cloud
#
# ── Live web dashboard link (optional) ───────────────────────────────────────
# EXPO_PUBLIC_WEB_BASE_URL=http://localhost:3000
